{{!-- The whole command-palette.tsx file: the Ctrl+K / Cmd+K palette that opens a page of the dashboard.
CommandPaletteProvider holds the shortcut and the dialog, CommandPaletteTrigger is the search field of the sidebar header.
It reads from the project: @repo/ui (command, sidebar), useMounted, useAllowedRoutes for the pages the user can open, the `search.records` procedure of the tRPC router for the records, and the router of the stack.
icons="hugeicons": the icons come from Hugeicons (default: lucide-react), and a page icon is a Hugeicons icon object.
pageAccess="organization": the pages follow the permissions of the active organization, which the browser resolves, so the provider takes no role and useAllowedRoutes() takes none (default: the provider takes the role of the user and passes it to useAllowedRoutes(role)). --}}
